n. He chooses the a pawn and keeps his c pawn. } 3. Kf3 3... a4 4. Ke4 4... Kg6 { The result has changed. Our sacrifices clear the a column. [%cal Rh7g6] }) 2... bxc6 { He takes again. Push your a pawn to a6 and let it run. [%cal Ya5a6] } 3. a6 { The a column is clear. Your pawn reaches promotion before his pawns can. [%cal Ga5a6] } (3. Kg1 { This changes the result. Your king takes a different route. } 3... bxa5 4. Kh1 4... a4 5. Kh2 5... Kg7 { The result has changed. Our sacrifices clear the a column. [%cal Rh7g7] }) (3. Kh2 { This changes the result. Your king takes a different route. } 3... bxa5 4. Kh3 4... Kh6 5. Kg4 5... Kg6 { The result has changed. Our sacrifices clear the a column. [%cal Rh6g6] }) (3. Kg2 { This changes the result. Your king takes a different route. } 3... bxa5 4. Kf2 4... a4 5. Ke3 5... a3 { The result has changed. Our sacrifices clear the a column. [%cal Ra4a3] }) (3. axb6 { This changes the result. Your pawn takes a different route. } 3... cxb6 4. Kg2 4... Kg6 5. Kf1 5... Kf6 { The result has changed. Our sacrifices clear the a column. [%cal Rg6f6] }) 1-0


