om a8 she guards h1, so his pawn cannot promote safely. [%cal Ga7a8] } (6. Kc4 { This changes the result. Your king takes a different route. } 6... h1=Q 7. Kb5 7... Qa8 8. Kxb6 8... Kh6 { The result has changed. Our new queen on a8 would guard h1. [%cal Rg7h6] }) 1-0


